# Markdown files except README.md, changelogs, and changeset entries
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!SECURITY.md
!SUPPORT.md
!OPEN_SOURCE_CHECKLIST.md
!.github/**/*.md
!.changeset/*.md

scripts/*
!scripts/verify.sh
!scripts/verify/
!scripts/__tests__/

# Local agent tooling — intentionally not tracked.
# Spec Kit scaffolding and generated constitution are reinstalled per machine
# via `specify init` + ../scripts/sync-constitution.sh.
# `specs` is a symlink to ../specs/<repo>, so specs live outside this repo.
#
# .specify/memory/constitution.md and .specify/templates/spec-template.md are
# exceptions: both carry real repo-specific customization (constitution
# content; the Blast Radius section, specs/015-blast-radius-spec-section)
# that a bare `specify init` would not reproduce, and scripts/verify.sh's
# Blast Radius check (like the constitution drift check) must find this
# content in CI, which checks out only this repo. They have to be tracked to
# be checkable there — same reasoning already applied to constitution.md.
.specify/*
!.specify/scripts/
!.specify/memory/
.specify/memory/*
!.specify/memory/constitution.md
!.specify/templates/
.specify/templates/*
!.specify/templates/spec-template.md
.claude/skills/
/specs
